grated theme toggling functionality with local storage support.\n- Updated global styles to reflect new theme colors and improved dark mode support.\n- Refactored Problems component to utilize centralized color management.\n- Enhanced Problems list with a table layout for better organization and readability.\n- Updated database service to sort todos by creation date instead of deadline.\n- Modified TodoItem type to include new fields for better data structure.\n- Introduced centralized color management for consistent theming across components.", "created_at": "2025-06-10T15:08:30Z", "repo": "leet-code", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c4af613a21fdc41fa6391a0868bf416258894718", "message": "feat: Enhance ProblemView and Problems components with improved error handling, loading states, and dark mode support\n\n- Refactored ProblemView to include error state management and loading indicators.\n- Added functionality to delete problems with confirmation prompts.\n- Improved markdown rendering for problem intuition and implementation sections using ReactMarkdown and SyntaxHighlighter.\n- Updated Problems component to streamline problem listing and filtering logic.\n- Enhanced UI with dark mode styles and improved accessibility features.\n- Modified database service methods to handle problem updates and deletions more effectively.\n- Updated Supabase client configuration and removed unused fetch proxy logic.\n- Revised Problem type definition to include optional fields for better flexibility.\n- Enabled class-based dark mode in Tailwind CSS configuration.", "created_at": "2025-05-27T18:37:04Z", "repo": "leet-code", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a386c4c6021281da695a4f48bf4b3334b2e6b852", "message": "Turn into a web project for better storing and reviewing solved problems", "created_at": "2025-05-27T06:06:23Z", "repo": "leet-code", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has